---
import SubWindow from '../SubWindow.astro';
---

<SubWindow id="modal-about-site" title="About this site">
  <div class="about-site-content">
    <h3>code.rodmachen.com</h3>
    <p>A tech and code writing hub by Rod Machen, styled after classic Mac OS 8.1.</p>

    <h4>Tech Stack</h4>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Astro 5.x</strong> — static site generator</li>
      <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — deployment and hosting</li>
      <li><strong>TypeScript</strong> — type-safe scripting</li>
      <li><strong>ChicagoFLF font</strong> — the authentic Mac OS system typeface</li>
      <li><strong>Playwright</strong> — end-to-end testing</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>Design Inspiration</h4>
    <p>
      The interface is inspired by Mac OS 8.1 (circa 1997–1998): the Platinum
      appearance, Bondi Blue desktop, pinstripe title bars, and classic
      window chrome. Writing about code feels right inside the OS that made
      many of us fall in love with computers.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a href="https://github.com/rodmachen/code-rodmachen-com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        View source on GitHub
      </a>
    </p>
  </div>
</SubWindow>

<style>
  .about-site-content h3 {
    font-family: 'ChicagoFLF', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .about-site-content h4 {
    font-family: 'ChicagoFLF', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }
  .about-site-content ul {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .about-site-content p {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
